{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A short horror game where you try to escape from a bathroom using a point-and-click interface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strange phenomena in a restroom that should be empty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A teacher who never comes out from the neighboring stall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Items that shouldn\u2019t be there appear in the restroom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the terrifying experience of facing eerie situations in a bathroom with no way out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game progresses mainly through movies.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Highly immersive 360\u00b0 exploration scene</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ability to return to branching scenes from the scenario chart.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >[/list]</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2974460?t=1749220863","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2974460?t=1749220863","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974460/131dc7c2d9702929e30ee1abcdf811ed7b06ecf5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749220863","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2974460/131dc7c2d9702929e30ee1abcdf811ed7b06ecf5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749220863","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"It includes fear-provoking effects such as bleeding and bodily injury."},"detailed_description":"<p clas